 "transcript": "Higher interest rates, harder application sequences, and extra verification on credit cards make funding harder to get every single year. One part of getting funding has stayed exactly the same for the 10 years I've been doing it, and it decides who still gets approved for the most. That part works the same whether your credit is great or somewhere in the middle or whether you already have a business or not. If you take the time to learn it and work a system, you go from You go from where you are right now to hundreds of thousands of dollars in funding, potentially even millions, and you keep doing it over and over for as long as the banking system exists. So I built Capital Blueprint, a dashboard that walks you through, walks you through it one waypoint at a time. It also gets you to pass the exact point where most people quit learning funding. Each waypoint tells you exactly what move to make next and shows you visually how to get there. It tells you which letters to send to optimize your credit. Which banks to apply to in the exact order. It shows you which banks to open up accounts with when you need them and how to start to optimize your businesses. The system holds you accountable and nudges you so every move you make is the right one while you focus on making money. Only about one in eight people ever finish an online course they sign up for. With the blueprint, you skip the hours of videos and note taking go straight to making. Go straight to making the next move on your own file so you can buy a $5,000 course or pay some of $4,000 a month for data points and a lot of people selling funding right now don't even know what they're doing. Every data point I've collected over the last decade is built into under-write IQ the software that builds your blueprint so you get the data from day one. The part that's the part that stayed the same for 10 years is how your file is optimized and set up before you ever apply. Get that right and you give yourself the best possible chance at the maximum amount of funding no matter what the banks change. Click the link below and hop on a call and we'll look at where your file is right now and map out your first moves.",
